#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:33 0ea7b5ecfa7c4cb0a212f397b7d42e92
msgid ""
"It is critically important that the ArduPilot knows the orientation of each "
"leg when the servos are centered. The code assumes that, when all the servos"
" are centered, the coxa faces directly away from the body, the femur is "
"level with the ground, and the tibia is at an angle of 90 degrees relative "
"to the femur."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"必须知道舵机居中时每条腿的方向，这一点至关重要。代码假设当所有舵机居中时，髋节直接朝向身体外侧，股节与地面水平，胫节相对股节成90度角。"

