#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:130 512babfa43074cffbab8460a82ac906d
msgid ""
"Set a :ref:`transmitter switch<common-auxiliary-functions>` for arming. "
"Ensure the channel used for the switch has been :ref:`calibrated<common-"
"radio-control-calibration>`. To configure a channel for arming, for example "
"channel 7, then set the parameter:"
msgstr ""
"设置一个用于解锁的 :ref:`遥控器开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>`。确保该开关所用通道已完成 :ref:`校准 "
"<common-radio-control-calibration>`。例如将通道 7 配置为解锁通道，则设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:132 21295ae8dca54e73b985374d75b5ab6f
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` =41 (Sets function of channel 7 as "
"arming/disarming)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 41（将通道 7 功能设置为解锁/上锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:134 48e720b99e74431fa194f5ade2966e12
msgid ""
"Connect the battery. Connect the autopilot board to GCS via USB or "
"telemetry."
msgstr "连接电池，通过 USB 或数传将飞控板连接到 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:136 c8fb1b17b60441f8b922de941f23d947
msgid ""
"Keep the robot on its belly and then arm it. If arming is not successful "
"check the error message on the GCS and identify the problem from the "
":ref:`rover arming page<arming-your-rover>`."
msgstr ""
"将机器人腹部朝下放置，然后解锁。如果解锁不成功，请查看 GCS 上的错误信息，并参照 :ref:`Rover 解锁页面<arming-your-"
"rover>` 排查问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/walking-robots.rst:138 5ece2d899924435fab9dcd8574fac5d6
msgid "After the autopilot board arms, the robot should stand up on it's own"
msgstr "飞控板解锁后，机器人应自行站立。"

